{
    "initializationAction": [
        "q.run_command('tag ' + q.player.username + ' add InDialogue');"
    ],
    "escapeAction": [],
    "speakers": {
        "sycamore": {
            "name": "Sycamore",
            "face": {
                "type": "artificial",
                "modelType": "npc",
                "identifier": "cobblemon:professorsycamore",
                "isLeftSide": true
            }
        },
        "player": {
            "face": "q.player.face(true);",
            "name": {
                "type": "expression",
                "expression": "q.player.username"
            }
        }
    },
    "pages": [
        {
            "id": "greeting",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "Hello..."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
                            "q.run_command('particle cloud 1501 101 271 2 2 2 1 100');",
                            "q.run_command('execute unless entity @e[x=1501,y=100,z=271,dy=3,type=cobblemon:npc] run npcspawnat 1501 101 271 couriway_sycamore');",
                            "q.run_command('execute as ' + q.player.username + ' run function kalos:triggers/stopsound');",
                            "q.run_command('execute as ' + q.player.username + ' run playsound sycamorestheme record @s[tag=!RadioOff] ~ ~ ~ 1 1 1');",
                            "q.run_command('execute as ' + q.player.username + ' run scoreboard players set @s[tag=!RadioOff] MusicCooldown 98');",
                            "q.dialogue.set_page('page2');"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page2",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "I have to apologize to you about Lysandre..."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page3');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page3",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "I'm very sorry for the trouble he caused..."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page4');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page4",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "And I'd also like to thank you!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page5');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page5",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "I'm sincerely grateful for what you did for all of the Pokémon and people of this world."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page6');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page6",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "And by stopping Team Flare, you also saved Lysandre."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page7');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page7",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "I always knew that he desired a beautiful world..."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
                            "q.dialogue.set_page('page8');"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page8",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "And maybe someday the population of people and Pokémon will actually increase to where resources become very scarce."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page9');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page9",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "If someone acts out of greed in such a world, surely some will go without."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page10');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page10",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "If all living things keep acting that way, there will be nothing left at all in the end."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page11');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page11",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "Why, there won't even be anything left to steal, will there?"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page12');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page12",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "But what I really wanted was for him to put his ego aside and lead everything to greater heights."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page13');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page13",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "I never had this discussion with him, though. So I'm partially responsible for this."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
                            "q.dialogue.set_page('page14');"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page14",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                {
                    "type": "expression",
                    "expression": "' Well, enough of that. ' + q.player.username + '!';"
                }
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
                            "q.dialogue.set_page('page15');"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page15",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "I want you and your Pokémon to take everything you learned from your journey and hit me with your very best shot!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Close",
                        "value": "close",
                        "action": [
                            "q.dialogue.close();",
                            "q.run_command('tag ' + q.player.username + ' add Dialogue135');",
                            "q.run_command('tag ' + q.player.username + ' remove InDialogue');"
                            ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        }
    ]
}